#: 7a8b45f666ae47ce888afc3ef9aba78b
msgid "Comparing framework performance"
msgstr "框架性能对比"

#: 25b2275bd00a4aa2b9a8528764a95eb1
msgid ""
"Jittor executes asynchronously and compiles operators on first use. A useful"
" benchmark therefore separates compilation from steady-state execution and "
"synchronizes the device around the measured interval."
msgstr "计图异步执行，并在首次使用时编译算子。因此，有效的基准测试必须把编译阶段与稳态执行分开，并在计时区间前后同步设备。"

#: 18a9ae9ee23642eb91f5ea8ecf73979f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"For repeatable, commit-indexed measurements, prefer the maintained "
"{doc}`../performance/benchmarking` ASV suite. The following pattern is "
"useful for a local model comparison:"
msgstr ""
"需要可重复且能关联到提交的结果时，请优先使用维护中的 {doc}`../performance/benchmarking` ASV "
"套件。下面的模式适合本地模型对比："

#: 0bf35c8060494ee1954b087666b54403
msgid ""
"Use the same warm-up count, input shape, dtype, evaluation mode, "
"accelerator, library versions, and synchronization policy for every "
"framework. Do not compare Jittor's first compile against another framework's"
" warm cache."
msgstr "所有框架必须使用相同的预热次数、输入形状、数据类型、评估模式、加速器、库版本和同步策略。不要拿计图的首次编译与另一个框架的热缓存结果比较。"

#: a863c6a5fe8a46bca9c31a19969e24ab
msgid "Validate numerical parity"
msgstr "验证数值一致性"

#: fcc623013309485e9e32a530fde1bcbd
msgid ""
"A faster result is not useful if it computes a different model. Before "
"timing:"
msgstr "如果计算的不是同一个模型，更快的结果没有意义。计时前应完成以下检查："

#: a5292cffff5f41b2966be3f8241ec670
msgid "Transfer identical parameters and input values."
msgstr "传入完全相同的参数和输入值。"

#: 77d2a8a358aa44a3a777b3b28faba9bd
msgid "Compare outputs outside the timed region."
msgstr "在计时区间之外比较输出。"

#: 3309b02ffd694e83ad463b98a2bc1f6b
msgid "Choose tolerances appropriate for the dtype and backend."
msgstr "根据数据类型和后端选择合适的误差容限。"

#: f42c754a32ac4706be65b23336bbcc1b
msgid "Confirm that both processes use the intended accelerator."
msgstr "确认两个进程都使用了预期的加速器。"

#: 3218015a7b5d4f328b6f98daf62117ed
msgid ""
"Monitor device memory so swapping or allocation pressure does not skew one "
"side of the comparison."
msgstr "监控设备内存，避免交换或分配压力只影响对比中的一方。"

#: 14e3cf3448ca4a72902ec5653acf2bcc
msgid ""
"For PyTorch, call `torch.cuda.synchronize()` before and after the measured "
"loop. For Jittor, call `jt.sync_all(True)` at the same boundaries. Report "
"the hardware, software versions, exact command, sample count, and dispersion"
" rather than a single unexplained throughput number."
msgstr ""
"PyTorch 应在计时循环前后调用 `torch.cuda.synchronize()`；计图应在相同边界调用 "
"`jt.sync_all(True)`。报告中应给出硬件、软件版本、完整命令、样本数和离散程度，而不是一个没有说明的吞吐量数字。"
